### Provisioning
# Create is the only endpoint that takes credentials. It creates the volume +
# container, runs an eager init boot, then leaves the database scaled to zero.
# Expect 201 with status "stopped".

@host = {{host}}

### Create a database
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/{{engine}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{dbName}}",
  "username": "{{dbUser}}",
  "password": "{{dbPassword}}"
}

### Create a second database (to test listing / isolation)
POST {{host}}/api/{{engine}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "analytics",
  "username": "haki",
  "password": "hunter2"
}

### Confirm it landed and is scaled to zero
GET {{host}}/api/databases
Accept: application/json